ont-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">住戶單純、通風好採光佳。~~~~~房間內有大金變頻冷暖氣</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">汐止市公共室內、外停車場、台鐵汐止站、市民游泳池、</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">市民體育場&nbsp;汐止免費社區巴士站&nbsp;、</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">公車汐止國小站.(605、605(副)、678、711、藍22、668)</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">中山高交流道口、近黃昏市場、汐止市民運動公園、</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">夜市、&nbsp;小吃攤、超商、金融、郵局、生活機能絕佳、、、.</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">免公設電費.............每月200元x12個月=2400元</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">免水費</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">免第四台.網路費</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">免管理費.................每月300元x12個月=3600元</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">免清潔費.................公設區域每週派人清潔整理一次~~~~</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333339691162px;\"><span style=\"color:#009900;\">◆其他補充：限上班族‧學生&nbsp;</span></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-fam